
                                  WD-AdBBS 1.0

       [****************************************************************]

	Introduction

	This is my third arexx program to be released for c-net.
	The main idea is that users can add their favorite bbs'es to
	your logoff screen, or sysops can add theirs.
	To get a hum of how it looks load the picture supplied in this
        archive into your picture viewing program. Quite neat huh? :)

        *********************
        * I-M-P-O-R-T-A-N-T *
        *********************

        The program modiefies the systext:sys.end file, so if you want
        to keep it intact, or want to redirect the file to i.e GFILES:
        then modify the filepath in the arexx program itself.

       [****************************************************************]

	Legal Stuff

	This door is public domain you can spread is as much as you like
	as long as the original archive is intact.

       [****************************************************************]

	Usage

	Not much to say here, the program speaks for itself, when you
        run the program for the first time, an error message comes up
        that says: systext:sys.end does not exist.
        This is ok, the file will be created created the first time
        the program is run.

       [****************************************************************]

	Installation

	Copy the main-program to PFILES: and add the following line to
	your bbsmenu file:

	adbbs |{#0Pfiles:WD-ABBS.rexx}
	       ^------.
	              Control-Q

	Reload the Text/Menu and you're done. Easy isn't it?

       [****************************************************************]

